#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:454
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&marble; can be compiled as a &Qt; 4-only version as well as featuring &kde; "
"4 support. To compile &marble; with &Qt; 4-only support check out &marble; "
"from &kde; SVN into ~/marble and just do: <command>cmake -DQTONLY=ON ~/"
"marble</command> and <command>sudo make install</command>. To compile "
"&marble; with &kde; support check instructions on how to compile &kde; "
"applications at <ulink url=\"http://techbase.kde.org/marble\">&kde;'s "
"TechBase</ulink>."
msgstr ""

